task_outcome OUT_T_OBSERVATION_PROTOCOL:
  model 1
  task T_OBSERVATION_PROTOCOL
  against_basis sha256:996c695d42c8c0529df3e64777fe7967dd892266a0b20b2dea0610ebb9e18641
  status conformant
  reason "The protocol records persisted-turn insufficiency, rejects prose-based inference, fixes a server-only privacy-safe envelope, local-file-only adapter boundary, sample and effectiveness gates, descriptive-only claims, and a separate capture-authority decision before runtime or data access."

task_outcome OUT_T_OFFLINE_OBSERVER:
  model 1
  task T_OFFLINE_OBSERVER
  against_basis sha256:015ab0efc9eaa791f1417519472a977ce9e021196c81a87089d7671b2a441227
  status conformant
  reason "A strict versioned privacy-safe envelope and explicit local-file-only observer were implemented. Seven targeted tests verify opaque refs, identical source digests, no private output, persisted-record insufficient_source without inference, dangling-ref reporting, mutation fail-closed behavior, and no DB network provider LLM XAI or runtime-service dependency. All 380 repository tests, typecheck, and build pass; actual capture remains untested and unauthorized."

task_outcome OUT_T_CAPTURE_AUTHORITY_DECISION:
  model 1
  task T_CAPTURE_AUTHORITY_DECISION
  against_basis sha256:b534913460293e09224de86130748d642a560d15b44180f39b9c624856fcffc1
  status changed
  summary "Actual-turn capture was deferred because required applicability inputs are not authoritatively derivable from the adopted runtime."
  reason "The user accepted defer for actual-turn-capture-authority-v1 on 2026-08-06. Runtime capture remains unauthorized and input derivability must be evaluated before authority is reconsidered."

task_outcome OUT_T_INPUT_DERIVATION_PROTOCOL:
  model 1
  task T_INPUT_DERIVATION_PROTOCOL
  against_basis sha256:a29da895b52290f4d8bf2594c634c936a761a6a81d580f307d19320639bf8c52
  status conformant
  reason "Protocol docs/battle-pipeline-actual-turn-input-derivability-protocol.md sha256:9ce6e1f62e7051ba8420e7ebb5aa2ee9591cece002700c4c990eeb2471f2f69b freezes the five-field authoritative source map, twenty preregistered fixtures, hard effectiveness metrics, fail-closed rules, ordinary-runtime availability 0/5, and exclusions for runtime hooks DB network provider LLM XAI canonical writes persistence release and deployment."
